							"kind": "field",
							"name": "useBakedModel",
							"signature": "bool useBakedModel = false",
							"doc": "Render from the baked .mmodel instead of regenerating the mesh at load.\nThe bake only paid off once something consumed it: the file was written\nand then ignored, so a packaged build still re-triangulated every room\non the way in. With this on the mesh comes through the normal asset\npath, which is also what gets meshlets and LODs once the cook learns to\nreprocess .mmodel.",
